Variable New_trade_amount_by_
Title: New trade amount by sector
Units: $US
Description: This is the projected level of US imports and US exports in US$, by sector.~
~
It is computed by using the project price change for imports and exports (Trade_price_increase) after the tariff, and the trade_elasticity, which captures the sensitivity to price changes.
Definition: Cur_trade_amount * exp( - Trade_elasticity * Trade_price_increase)
NodeLocation: 424,440,1
NodeSize: 56,32
WindState: 2,557,542,720,350
ValueState: 2,487,257,631,329,,CDFP
ReformVal: [Trade_direction,Null,Undefined,Undefined,1]
{!40000|Att_XRole: -1}
{!40000|Att_ColorRole: Null}

Variable Domestic_price_incre
Title: Domestic price increase
Description: The percent change in domestic prices across each sector.
Definition: Sum( Value_share_to_goods * Domestic_equil_price, Material ) * degree_to_which_cost
