Variable New_trade_deficit
Title: New trade deficit
Units: $US
Description: The projected US trade by sector after the tariff is imposed.
Definition: New_trade_amount_by_[ Trade_direction='Imports'] - New_trade_amount_by_[Trade_direction='Exports' ]
NodeLocation: 608,440,1
NodeSize: 56,32
ValueState: 2,419,205,627,387,,MEAN

Variable Cur_trade_deficits
Title: Cur trade deficits
Units: $US
Description: The current US trade deficit by sector -- a positive number means a greater monetary value of goods is imported than exported.
Definition: Cur_trade_amount[Trade_direction='Imports'] - Cur_trade_amount[Trade_direction='Exports']
